      "delete": {
        "summary": "Cancel a scheduled email",
        "description": "Stops a message whose status is scheduled; it becomes canceled. The status change is what the scheduler checks before sending, so a 200 means it will not go out even if its time had come. Anything not scheduled is 409, including a draft held for approval (queued): withdraw that by rejecting its approval. A 409 is final for this message; do not retry.",
