      "post": {
        "summary": "Add a contact to an audience",
        "description": "The same as POST /v1/audiences/{id}/contacts with one contact, for a caller that starts from the person. audience_id is required: a contact is always added to a list. An upsert on the address, safe to retry: an address already in the workspace joins this audience, keeps its other memberships and answers 201 too. Someone new to the audience starts its contact_added automations, and a tag the contact did not already carry starts tag_added automations watching it (neither is reported). Never resubscribes an unsubscribed contact; use PATCH /v1/contacts/{id} for that. For many people, send an array to POST /v1/audiences/{id}/contacts instead.",
