      "patch": {
        "summary": "Update a contact",
        "description": "Changes a contact's names, attributes or subscription; fields left out are not touched. Attributes merge and are coerced to their declared property types. unsubscribed: true is a full unsubscribe (flag, marketing suppression, pending sends cancelled, enrolments ended); unsubscribed: false resubscribes. A resubscribe that is refused (409) writes nothing, including the names and attributes in the same body; do not retry it, remove the suppression deliberately first. The address, tags and memberships cannot be changed here: use POST /v1/contacts/{id}/tags and the audience endpoints.",
