        "description": "Removes the person from the workspace with every membership, tag, attribute and engagement date. To take someone off one list only, use DELETE /v1/audiences/{id}/contacts/{contact_id}. Suppressions and topic preferences are kept, because they belong to the person. Deleting does not unsubscribe, cancel scheduled sends or end enrolments: to stop mail, PATCH with unsubscribed: true first.",
