        "description": "Send only what should change; each field sent replaces the stored value whole (a properties array replaces every filter). Clear tags, exclude_tags or properties with [], the topic with \"\", and opened_within_days, clicked_within_days, exclude_unengaged_days or engaged_within_days with null. key cannot be changed: a body containing key, even the current one, is 422 invalid_request and changes nothing. A campaign that has started sending has frozen its recipients and is unaffected.",
        "x-required-scope": "contacts:write",
        "parameters": [
