      "get": {
        "summary": "List campaigns",
        "description": "Campaigns in the workspace, newest first (by created_at, then id), cursor-paged: pass next_cursor back as cursor while has_more is true. Items leave out html, since a list is for finding a campaign; GET /v1/broadcasts/{id} returns the body. Every other field is what retrieve returns, including live progress and A/B results.",
