            "description": "invalid_request: the body failed validation. details lists each field. Also idempotency_key_reused: this Idempotency-Key was already used on this path with a different request body (checked right after the scope, so a credential without the scope gets 403 instead, and answered at once even while the first request is still running). Do not retry; send the new request under a new key.",
