      "post": {
        "summary": "Set one person's topic preferences",
        "description": "Records a person's choice for one or more topics. Only do this when the person asked: re-subscribing someone who opted out is what produces spam complaints. Opting out (false) immediately ends their active enrolments in every automation sent under that topic. Opting in (true) restarts nothing and does not lift a suppression. Every key is checked before anything is written, so an unknown_topic refusal saved nothing and the corrected call can be retried whole. Topics not named are left as they are.",
